// eth_probe — AMP P3 sim gate program (runs from core-2 local RAM):
// writes 0x5A5A to a LiteEth CSR (0xF006_0010), reads it back and stores the
// value to DDR 0x0100_0200; reads the clock_ms mirror (0xF00F_0040) and
// stores it to 0x0100_0208; HALTs.  With C2_ETH_OWNER=0 the readback must be
// 0 (request never routed, no hang); with OWNER=1 it must be 0x5A5A.
_start
SETR B 0xF0060010
SETR A 0x5A5A
MEMSET32 A B
MEMREADRR C B
SETR D 0x01000200
MEMSET64 C D
SETR B 0xF00F0040
MEMREADRR C B
SETR D 0x01000208
MEMSET64 C D
HALT
